      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack, thanks for the clarification. If there is no functional reason to introduce this code, and it is just the test, I would prefer that we modify the test to deal with EXDEV.\n\nThe reason we originally did this change was that applications were already (incorrectly) written with the assumption that they could move files between directories (eg their data and cache dirs) without encountering EXDEV. So we introduced this change to avoid appcompat issues. But if there are no such known appcompat issues on ARC, we should just modify the test to deal with EXDEV for this dir.",
